WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:19.500
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.680
Episode 5
Mirror of the Underworld

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.120
How long are you going to keep following me?

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.250
It is my duty to protect you.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.020
But nothing is really happening.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.130
Then do not mind me—

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.890
Shinryuu Shouken.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.760
Descendant of the Shinryuu family,

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:07.830
well-versed in medical science, and with 
a body that is resistant to poison.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.050
He has also mastered various martial arts

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.650
which makes him an incredibly 
skilled bodyguard.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.770
Not really, but I am enough 
to protect the young master.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:23.370
Give up being his bodyguard 
and protect me instead.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:25.740
Jiun...

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.500
Don't act so familiar with me! 
You are to address me as "my lady."

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.500
M-My lady.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.010
Hmph, you're so full of 
yourself for an outsider.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.700
Why do you need a bodyguard instead of me?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.260
You stole my hair ornament, 
didn't you? I know you did.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.520
M-Me?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.530
Don't try to play dumb.

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:53.480
Not even one of the servants would 
care about such a cheap thing.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.940
Who else would steal it but you?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.190
It wasn't me.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.040
Well, whatever.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.860
You probably try to get your 
hands on so many things

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:06.250
because your mother was never 
able to buy you anything.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.530
You're the Youmeishi for heaven's sake.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:13.430
I'll just give you the stupid hair 
ornament if you want it so bad.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.670
I didn't steal it! And don't
talk badly about my mom!

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.300
Are you trying to put the blame on me?

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.640
I'm really not.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.600
Still defying me?
 If you don't admit it, I'll—

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:35.910
I had heard that the young master 
had not been accepted by everyone...

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.480
Let go of me.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.560
But I did not think it was this bad.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.570
What was that?

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.450
How dare you hit me?!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.420
Protecting the young master 
is my duty. Please forgive me.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:56.710
Do you have any idea what 
you've done, bodyguard?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.880
Yes, and I am sorry.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.950
I will apologize for raising 
a hand against you,

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.140
but you also need to apologize 
to the young master.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.760
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.640
I am being serious.

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:13.770
Please apologize.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.770
I-It's fine. Don't be mean to a girl.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.490
Should I give her special 
treatment because she is a girl?

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:25.350
I raised my hand to her 
because she made a mistake.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.680
I apologized for my own misdeeds.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:31.120
Mistakes are not beholden to gender.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.490
Do you not think so, young master?

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.690
Looking for something?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:57.570
Jiun was upset because the hair ornament 
she lost was probably important to her.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:02.670
She comes here a lot to read, so I figure
 she might have dropped it here.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.510
You are going to help her even 
though she falsely accused you?

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.820
I knew it'd be here.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.160
See? Just like I thought.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:14.960
Please excuse me.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:18.330
We have a favor to ask of Ki-sama.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.210
Will you give this to Jiun for me?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:23.640
Yes.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:49.050
<i>He's shady, throwing away 
the hair ornament like that.</i>

00:05:54.830 --> 00:06:00.710
Why did you eat it if you are not supposed 
to eat food made by other people?

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.470
She is a distant relative and she 
was begging to see the Youmeishi.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:12.600
We have been blessed with good 
weather thanks to the Youmeishi.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:17.330
The mistress of the household permitted 
me to bring you this as thanks.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.580
Thank you.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.810
I thought it'd be fine if 
I just ate a little bit.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:26.400
She came from so far away,
 so I didn't want to disappoint her.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.860
Please refrain next time.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.800
I'm fine.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:34.210
This happens all the time.
 I'll be better after some rest.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.330
This always happens?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:40.040
I don't want to be thought of as a 
special person with a weird diet.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.570
What are you talking about?

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:44.390
It is not a weird diet. 
It's just your constitution.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.010
You do not need the same 
things other people do!

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.540
It is not something to feel so humble about.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:51.640
But...

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:55.930
Did you think such things when 
you were standing at the altar?

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:02.520
Is it worth sacrificing yourself for 
the happiness of someone else?

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.020
I have never thought of it as a sacrifice.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:10.280
It makes me glad when everyone feels happy.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:19.040
My heart is full when I am
offering up my prayers.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:24.000
I am content when I can listen 
and respond to everyone's wishes.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.710
So I enjoy it.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.010
Is that so?

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.990
What's wrong? Why did you ask me that?

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.910
I did not mean anything particular by it.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:47.780
I will manage your diet and 
daily life from now on,

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.070
so that nothing like this ever happens again.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:55.650
This is the first time I've had 
someone so concerned about me.

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.290
It is my duty to protect you.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:08.630
<i>It's just like you said, brother. 
He is the natural-born Youmeishi.</i>

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.820
You're so good at everything.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:07.400
I am not so impressive compared 
to the power of your memory.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.860
Why do you burn my hair that has fallen out?

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:20.050
The body of the Youmeishi is divine.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:25.870
Anything that leaves your body must be 
burned so that no one can misuse it.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.500
It is my duty to protect you.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:39.390
Shouken, you kind of remind me...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.510
of my mom.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:44.520
I remind you of your mother?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.130
I didn't really know you that well at first,

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:52.600
and I didn't want to be a bother, 
so I didn't think I needed a guard.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.900
But now I'm grateful to the Tanmoku family.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:00.990
I'm glad you're by my side.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.010
<i>Burning secret letters.</i>

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:20.650
<i>Shinryuu Shouken, why did you 
get so close to Tanmoku Ki?</i>

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:32.460
Young master, do you want to 
become the head of the family?

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:33.270
Huh?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:38.030
You could have that position,
if you so desired.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.450
I'm not fit for it.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.490
They already have the 
acting head and Jiun too.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.870
Is there anything you want to do?

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:52.010
If you became the head of the family, 
you could gain your freedom,

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.790
live your life like a normal person,
 and even go to school.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.410
Do you not want to see the outside world?

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:01.130
If I could ever leave this mountain, there 
are definitely things I want to do.

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:03.890
But it doesn't matter.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.000
The future head of the family is Jiun.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.770
And I don't want to fight for it.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:24.070
This is a storehouse management problem, 
right? So stop trying to blame my store!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.930
The medicinal ingredients 
are bought all at once

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.010
and the main Tanmoku family 
is also using the same things,

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.660
so it's clearly an issue on your end!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.170
Are you trying to say we 
switched out the medicine?

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.480
I heard the people who took 
medicine from the shop died.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.170
Try asking your conscience.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.170
Really?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.930
I would say the same—

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:36.940
Stop it.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.050
I will have the acting head investigate.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:41.660
That will not do!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.770
The supervisor for the medicine 
shop is the acting head's uncle.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:47.070
He cannot do an official investigation!

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:49.510
And you're the mistress's niece!

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:52.910
All the people working in 
this household are connected.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:56.610
Have you realized something, young master?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.920
Do you know something?

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:01.960
Well...

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:10.260
All the people who took the medicine seemed 
like they were possessed by evil spirits.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.100
Do you mean that there is an 
evil spirit in this mansion?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.040
It could also be the work of a human.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.730
You are the Youmeishi, Ki-sama, 
but you are still a child.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:27.050
Saying it could be an evil spirit or 
a human... You lack consistency.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.430
Silence!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.810
Do you have any kind of basis for this?

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:38.690
I might be able to find out by looking 
at the ledger and storehouse records.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.950
Did you hear? Ki-sama 
has done something great!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:47.650
Apparently the storehouse manager was 
selling medicine illegally for higher prices

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.330
and no one had any idea.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:53.830
That's right, and I heard he's still 
investigating on the mistress's orders.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.360
People who work to cheat 
others get what they deserve.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.330
Congratulations on your big achievement.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:12.430
Well?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.010
This lingzhi mushroom should be 
800 grams, but it's not quite right.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:20.730
Maybe it was switched out. Look.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.360
Why would someone switch it out?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:24.880
Perhaps...

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:28.100
There may have been some issue with 
the original lingzhi mushrooms.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.980
Young master.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:32.420
Who are you?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.500
I know who switched out the lingzhi mushroom.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.850
Please open the door. We are 
conducting an investigation.

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:01.980
We ask for your cooperation.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.490
You're making all kinds of noise 
with the shouting, what is it?

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:18.840
The young master is investigating 
the illegal selling of medicine

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.130
on the mistress's orders.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.250
I am sorry for bothering you at night,

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.980
I believe you would be the 
last person to be involved,

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.300
but please allow me to
 investigate, just in case.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.740
I was up late last night 
discussing an exorcism case

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:32.260
with a member of the Shito 
family and I'm tired,

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:32.970
so go away.

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:37.840
I can feel a surge of spiritual energy 
coming from your room. Could it be?

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:40.980
An evil spirit that puts a deadly 
curse on people who take the medicine?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.610
Don't be ridiculous! I'm going to bed.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:47.440
It would be troubling if anything 
happened to someone so important.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.240
Excuse me.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.740
Such rudeness. Leave!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.530
What is this?

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.790
Don't touch it!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.510
This is the lingzhi sekisui mushroom.

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:14.410
What are you doing with a spiritual 
medicine that has the ability

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:15.880
to revive someone from the brink of death?

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:19.610
I heard that his son was suffering
 from a serious illness a few years ago,

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.470
but was miraculously healed. Perhaps he...

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:28.740
I only used this spiritual 
medicine to save my son's life!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.110
Is that so?

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.650
Only the head can touch it.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.630
But you have touched it too, 
haven't you, acting head?

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.870
Don't go getting all cocky, 
you lowly bodyguard!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.770
Shouken!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.730
I am fine.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.000
Only the head can touch it, right?

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:04.810
You've been weakened and confined for 
so long, and you can't talk either?

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.980
Acting head, what is the meaning of this?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.990
Wh-What do you mean?

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:14.860
I sensed the same miasma in the 
people who took the medicine.

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:18.200
That boy is undoubtedly an evil spirit!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.160
You've finally managed to capture him.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:20.870
Sir.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.860
The young master may only be 14 years old,

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:27.040
but no spirit can tell a lie in front of him.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:33.050
<i>The mirror of the underworld.</i>

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.400
<i>The left hand goes back in time,</i>

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.820
<i>while the right hand recreates it.</i>

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.400
Teacher!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.330
I will give you the name Sekisui.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.150
Okay.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:17:03.370
Even though I'm well-versed in the healing 
arts, I can't even save my own child?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.170
Teacher, it's going to be okay.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.170
I will save him.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.760
Receiving the favor of a spirit 
should be a moving experience...

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.240
Father!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:18.220
If we sell that boy's body as medicine, 
we could save countless lives!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:22.350
But human greed knows no bounds.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:31.230
I'll cut just a little bit from you 
every day, but I won't kill you.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.990
As the days and months flowed,

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.290
you made a name for yourself 
as a doctor of herbal medicine.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.870
People came from all over 
seeking medicine from you.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.810
But they had no idea the 
medicine was being made

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.540
by cutting away the life of a spirit!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.620
It takes lingzhi thousands 
of years to gain human form

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.940
and then another ten thousand 
years to gain a soul.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.830
The spirit of a lingzhi who has 
continually had it's life exhausted will

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:55.110
become a spirit that creates 
miasma that is harmful to humans.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:58.470
So that's why you switched 
him with the new lingzhi.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.260
But too much time had passed 
and it was already too late.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.270
It's all right now.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.010
I am that boy's teacher and 
I've been like a father to him!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.040
He's supposed to repay me for that, right?

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.030
Didn't he already save your son?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.760
Acting head, you desire too much.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:21.060
I will report this matter to the mistress.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.080
Don't take the boy!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.750
You're not the head, are you?

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.190
Don't just do as you please!

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.640
I am the Youmeishi of the Tanmoku family.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:33.550
I could become the head of 
the family, if I so desired.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:37.090
That's why this is the end 
for you as the acting head.

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:44.010
Who cares about the head?

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.380
You're so naive.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:48.210
Everyone in this mansion has eaten him.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:51.400
They have all eaten his flesh.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.900
You are no exception either!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:59.370
I am the only one in the 
mansion who hasn't eaten him.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.560
You have no right to blame me.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.870
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:07.250
He was medicine to begin with.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.060
What's so wrong with taking medicine?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:14.540
How many lives have people 
stolen in order to live?

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.710
You should refrain from talking down to me!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.970
I understand the principle 
of equivalent exchange.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:28.350
The whole of creation revolves 
according to the laws of nature.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:34.700
My powers were given to me by nature, 
and they will one day return to nature.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:38.450
Things gained by humans are 
never an exception.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.900
They will return to where they came from.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:46.580
However, that cannot be a 
reason to commit evil deeds.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.710
If you take that boy with 
you now, you will regret it.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.500
You will definitely regret 
it in the near future!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.730
Is it really okay for me to take him?

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:09.020
If the Tanmoku family comes after him, 
there will be nowhere to hide.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.450
I won't let that happen.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.150
What is it?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.680
It is the mark of a mystical plant.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:27.030
If you take it and come to see him,
 I am sure this child will return the favor.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.860
I finally understand what you 
were trying to say, Shouken.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.170
What do you mean, young master?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:46.410
In order to realize the ideals 
I have in my heart, I need power.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:51.180
That is why I have decided I'm going to 
become the head of the Tanmoku family.

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:58.190
I will lay down my life to 
help you realize your dream.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.810
<i>Was that Tanmoku Ki's past?</i>

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.790
<i>That Shinryuu Shouken person 
was in all of his memories.</i>

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.460
<i>But there's something strange about him.</i>

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:23.840
<i>More nightmares?!</i>

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.460
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.030
<i>I have no powers.</i>

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:39.800
<i>Tanmoku Ki, your nightmares 
are trying to keep me out.</i>

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:42.290
<i>But I can't stop here.</i>

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.810
<i>I will keep going!</i>

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:32.020
Tanmoku Ki will become the thirteenth 
head of the Tanmoku family.

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:35.640
Master, is there anything
 you want to do?

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Elegy</b>

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.350
I want to find someone.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.080
Who would that be?
